    "description": "Sony Xperia's naming strategy has evolved over time. Early models used single letters (X, P, U, etc.) and later the Z series for flagships. In 2016, the X series replaced Z, and in 2019, Sony switched to a number-based system (Xperia 1, 5, 10) for clearer tiering. The 1 series is flagship, 5 is compact flagship, and 10 is mid-range. Pro and Ace are specialized lines for professionals and specific markets."
